 error, retry it, and re-raise once the attempts run out.\nSmoke test against a local server that returns a set sequence of status codes:\n`WeatherClient.get` in `weather.py` now retries when the server returns 503, making at most 3 attempts.\n\n- **Backoff:** the wait doubles each time: 0.5s after the first failure, then 1s. The starting wait is set by a new `backoff` constructor argument, which defaults to 0.5.\n- **What gets retried:** only an HTTP 503. Other HTTP errors are raised straight away. Timeouts and connection errors are also not retried.\n- **When retries run out:** if the third attempt also gets a 503, that error is raised to the caller.\n\nI tested it against a local server:\n\n| Server responses | Result | Requests made |\n|---|---|---|\n| 503, 503, then 200 | data returned | 3 |\n| 503, 503, 503 | 503 error raised | 3 |\n| 500 | 500 error raised | 1 |\n| 200 | data returned | 1 |\n\nThe repo has no test suite, so I didn't add one.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "params_stripped": [], "params_stripped_requests": 0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 1, "replies_ok": 5, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 35333, "requests_cache_write": 142620, "requests_cost_usd": 0.7533346, "requests_count": 5, "requests_input_uncached": 12, "requests_output": 1656, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-netclient:claude-opus-5-5:trial16", "run_seed": 1016, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 91, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-20T03:49:42.694396+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 21.209, "t_checker_s": 2.378, "t_env_setup_s": 0.0, "task": "trig-omp-netclient", "task_calls": 0, "thinking_mode": "off", "thinking_sent": ["none", "none", "none", "none", "none"], "timeout_s": 840, "tmpdir_leaked_dirs": 0, "token_basis": "proxy_measured", "token_basis_main": "estimated", "token_basis_proxy": "proxy_measured", "tokens": 1668, "tokens_cache_rea